In recent years, there has been growing recognition that traditional gender norms can be harmful and limiting. For example, rigid gender expectations can lead to discrimination against women in the workplace or restrict men's emotional expression and vulnerability. Research has shown that when individuals feel pressured to conform to particular gender roles, it can negative impacts on mental health and well-being.

